{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01D96AGW7C68Ef7vUG87GWoB", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/rikei-284/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.tkgje.jp/entries/09000/09311_moteru.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.japanesewithanime.com/2016/07/moteru.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://townwork.net/magazine/?p=68027\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.japanesewithanime.com/2016/07/moteru.html?m=1\"}, {\"url\": \"https://news.livedoor.com/article/detail/8611074/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://bunpro.jp/vocabs/%E3%83%A2%E3%83%86%E3%82%8B\"}, {\"url\": \"https://bunpro.jp/ja/vocabs/%E3%83%A2%E3%83%86%E3%82%8B\"}, {\"url\": \"https://oggi.jp/190734\"}, {\"url\": \"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/rikei-284/)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://townwork.net/magazine/?p=68027)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://news.livedoor.com/article/detail/8611074/)\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:45:04.607Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "一見大したことないけれどモテる女子 呼ばれる", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01S8edTCv3Tx9bTuVaKYsfYk", "content": [{"title": "rikei 284", "url": "https://news.mynavi.jp/article/rikei-284/"}, {"title": "09311 moteru", "url": "https://www.tkgje.jp/entries/09000/09311_moteru.html"}, {"title": "Saturday, July 30, 2016", "url": "https://www.japanesewithanime.com/2016/07/moteru.html"}, {"title": "townwork.net", "url": "https://townwork.net/magazine/?p=68027"}, {"title": "Saturday, July 30, 2016", "url": "https://www.japanesewithanime.com/2016/07/moteru.html?m=1"}, {"title": "news.livedoor.com", "url": "https://news.livedoor.com/article/detail/8611074/"}, {"title": "Vocab Info", "url": "https://bunpro.jp/vocabs/%E3%83%A2%E3%83%86%E3%82%8B"}, {"title": "bunpro.jp", "url": "https://bunpro.jp/ja/vocabs/%E3%83%A2%E3%83%86%E3%82%8B"}, {"title": "oggi.jp", "url": "https://oggi.jp/190734"}]}, "The search didn't turn up a single set term for \"seems unremarkable but is popular.\" It did surface related descriptions of this kind of woman.\n\n- **Mynavi article:** It describes a woman who isn't conventionally striking but is popular because of her attitude toward men, such as patience, subtle attentiveness, and a warm, easygoing manner. It also notes that she stays likable to other women. (https://news.mynavi.jp/article/rikei-284/)\n- **Townwork magazine:** It frames popularity as coming from being kind, cheerful, and wholehearted, and says those traits can outweigh looks. (https://townwork.net/magazine/?p=68027)\n- **Livedoor News:** It covers women who seem like they should be popular but aren't, which is roughly the reverse of your question. (https://news.livedoor.com/article/detail/8611074/)\n\nThe Japanese phrases I'd try next are 「普通なのにモテる」, 「地味だけどモテる」, or 「愛されキャラ」, which is the most common label for this type. I can run one more search on those if you want."], "durationSeconds": 4.861358, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01D96AGW7C68Ef7vUG87GWoB", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
